Of the required Data Science courses, only DS-GA 1002 may be waived. To have this course waived, students must submit the following materials for review:
- Undergraduate or Graduate Transcripts (must be translated);
- The course(s) used to waive DS-GA 1002 should be highlighted on the transcript, and the grades received should also be highlighted;
- Syllabi of the course(s) used for the waiver (must be translated);
- If available, the course website [1].
